        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 955RT, Contemporary Glass Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn update to a traditional knob, Omnia's 955RT Knobset features a clear glass scalloped knob with a rectangular rose. The modern shaped rose grants the glass knob a contemporary feel that makes it perfect for homes today. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. A delicate balance between hard and soft, the Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knob is a modern take on a classic. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Clear Glass Knob With Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 955RT Scalloped Glass Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knob, Omnia 955RT",
                "description": "Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knob Omnia 955RT - An update to a traditional knob, Omnia's 955RT Knobset features a clear glass scalloped knob with a rectangular rose. The modern shaped rose grants the glass knob a contemporary feel that makes it perfect for homes today. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. A delicate balance between hard and soft, the Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knob is a modern take on a classic. Available in 8 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-955RT, Omnia 955RT Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knobs, Traditional knobsets, classic knobsets, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs,  passage knobs, privacy knobs, vintage knobs, victorian glass knobs, Contemporary Glass Knobsets, Clear Glass Knobsets, Rectangular Rose with Clear Glass Knobs, square roses,"
